# Git commits: no trailers

When creating commits in this repo (shell or instructions):

- Use only a single-line subject when possible, e.g. `git commit -m "fix(scope): summary"`.
- Do **not** pass `git commit --trailer` (any trailer).
- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by:` or similar lines to the commit message body.
